  },
  "description": "Server-scoped changes from mssql_server_ddl (300s, last 4 days, cap 10000). Extended Events, audits, endpoints, credentials, server triggers, linked servers, and sp_configure. source=xe is observability_server_ddl and includes the actor and client host. source=trace is the default trace. source=catalog is create/modify date only, so Login and Client Host are a hyphen. STATE = START/STOP is started or stopped only when the XE session stored the batch. value Before/After is parsed from the English configuration message. event_time is SQL Server local time. Unix UTC is mssql_server_ddl_event_timestamp_seconds. XE Session 0 means the install script has not been run; trace and catalog rows are still collected.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Overview",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/sqlx-00-overview?${__url_time_range}&${instance:queryparam}"
